WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.463
Federal HR 2.0 is coming regardless.

2
00:00:03.463 --> 00:00:08.301
One government-wide platform replaces
more than a hundred HR systems,

3
00:00:08.301 --> 00:00:12.974
Oracle won the award in June, and
the second wave moves in fiscal 2027.

4
00:00:12.974 --> 00:00:14.975
You don't choose whether to implement it.

5
00:00:14.975 --> 00:00:17.437
You choose whether identity rides along.

6
00:00:17.437 --> 00:00:19.665
And this is the cheapest moment,

7
00:00:19.665 --> 00:00:24.975
because HR 2.0 rebuilds the interconnections
and cleans the HR data anyway.

8
00:00:24.975 --> 00:00:28.500
But nothing in the program
makes HR drive your directory.

9
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.012
That's yours to propose.

10
00:00:30.012 --> 00:00:33.333
The window closes when your
interconnection goes live,

11
00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:35.787
around month five in the sample timeline.

12
00:00:35.787 --> 00:00:40.968
So in the first phase, name the identity
feed as one of your integration points,

13
00:00:40.968 --> 00:00:43.963
and name HR as the source
in your Entra ID plan.

14
00:00:43.963 --> 00:00:45.430
Next, the data.
